  "details": "ive tried so many things but i still have problems with it. \nWhen ever i try to go to a random world it stop mid way the downloading and sends me back home, ive tried clearing my cache but still nothing. this isnt with every world but most of them which stops be from having fun with my friends.\nMy friends have hadd the same issue but it only lasted a day for them, this bug have been with me now for more then a week.\nMy internet is perfectly fine, i could be the only one using it but still cant load in.\nSome avatars are also blocked for me. I load into a world and lets say 1-8 avatars load for me out of 20 whos in that world.\nSometimes if i click ' show avatars' then ' hide avatars' then ' show avatars' it works but i have to repeat that 100x, sometimes after doing that it works but sommetimes it still doesn't.\nalso after i cleared my cache some of the avatars i had favoriterd couldnt load, it was just a error bot.\nI dont know what to do.",
